{"40":[{"k":"p","t":"6-2 Setting Mode"},{"k":"p","t":"This mode allows the changing of various game and price settings."},{"k":"p","t":"6-2-1 Setting Mode Operation"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Slide the Test switch on while pushing the Select switch."},{"k":"li","t":"2. The item and settings are displayed on the Dot Matrix Display. The selected item changes each time the Select switch is operated."},{"k":"li","t":"3. Press the Service switch to change the setting of the selected item."},{"k":"note","t":"Note: When setting the Ticket Payout number pull the gun trigger to change the value."},{"k":"li","t":"4. Slide the Test switch OFF to store the changed settings and to return to the normal game mode."},{"k":"note","t":"Note: Any credits established are lost each time the test switch is turned on or off."},{"k":"li","t":"5. To return the settings to the Factory Settings slide the test switch off while pressing the service switch."},{"k":"note","t":"Note:- The price of play on this machine is set within the Cashflow Coin Mech. Ensure that the Game Pricing is set to 1 Credit 1 Coin. Number Item Dot Matrix Display Description Factory Set Sets the price for 1 game"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   |Game pricing } 1 CREDIT - # COIN(S)   ie   toda   1"},{"k":"p","t":"Ticket mode Sets the ticket mode 2 TICKET MODE #"},{"k":"tr","t":"setting   # = [0] Non ticket / [1] Ticket mode   \u00b0"},{"k":"p","t":"Game start Sets the time for automatically starting each"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   amo   START TIME #sec   stage after READY displayed   8"},{"k":"p","t":"#= 1 to 15 (sec.) Game time Maximum time limit for each level"},{"k":"tr","t":"4   Minit   STAGE TIME #   #= 5/10/15 (sec.)   \u00b0"},{"k":"p","t":"Maximum number of shots for game"},{"k":"tr","t":"5   |No.ofshots | SHOTS LIMIT #   #2 15/20/25 /30   20"},{"k":"p","t":"Name entry Time limit for entering name"},{"k":"tr","t":"\u00a9   Time   mate ENV   #= 15/20/25 / 30/35/40   al"},{"k":"tr","t":"7   | Attract sound | ATTRACT SOUND #   # = [OJattract sound off / [1] attract sound on   1"},{"k":"p","t":"Sets the number of times that normal attract"},{"k":"tr","t":"g   [Moving   one aCe   mode is performed before a moving target   &"},{"k":"p","t":"attract attract mode is performed # = (Once in) 0 to 10 times Free ticket Sets whether a free ticket is given 9 FREE TKT # 1 setting # = [0] no ticket / [1] ticket given A=5 Sets the number of tickets to pay out. bea"},{"k":"tr","t":"to _ | Ticket payout | TKT   A BC D E   |Pull gun trigger to change thru A to E   23"},{"k":"tr","t":"No.   PAY NUMBER   \u2014#-#-#- # # | Use service switch to change the value   pa"},{"k":"p","t":"#=0t09 7 \u00b0 E=1"},{"k":"tr","t":",   iene   pends Dever   fae renk needed ter paying si a   ;"},{"k":"h","t":"payout score PAY RANK Pm = 0 (no bonus), 1 to 5 (pays out up to this"},{"k":"p","t":"setting ranking) Bonus ticket"},{"k":"tr","t":"2   fi   BONUS   Sets the number of bonus tickets to be payed.   50"},{"k":"p","t":"Payout No. PAY TICKET # #=0to 50 setting"}],"41":[{"k":"p","t":"6-2-2. Ticket Payout Setting"},{"k":"p","t":"= Do not operate in ticket mode without a ticket dispenser connected"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Free ticket setting This setting when ON will pay one ticket at the end of each game if no score tickets have been awarded."},{"k":"li","t":"2. Ticket payout No. setting This sets the number of tickets to be payed out depending upon achieved ranking at the end of each level. The game will give a rank between A to E as a default value according to the total time at the end of each level, and pays out the tickets (0 to 9 tickets) preset for that rank."},{"k":"p","t":"Payout ticket | Time at the end of | Time at the end of | Time at the end of | Time at the end of"},{"k":"tr","t":"Default value   Level 1   Level 2   Level 3   Level 4"},{"k":"tr","t":"Rank A   5 Tickets   0.799   1.999   2.999   3.999"},{"k":"tr","t":"Rank B   4 Tickets   0.999   2.499   3.499   4.999"},{"k":"tr","t":"Rank C   3 Tickets   1.499   2.999   3.999   5.999"},{"k":"tr","t":"Rank D   2 Tickets   1.999   3.499   4.499   6.999"},{"k":"tr","t":"Rank E   1 Ticket   2.000   3.500   5.000   7.000"},{"k":"li","t":"3. Bonus ticket payout score setting Pays out bonus tickets if the ranking of the total time is within the top 3 (can be set from the top 1 up to the top 5)."},{"k":"li","t":"4. Bonus ticket payout No. setting Sets the number of tickets to pay out to the player achieving the rank level set in 3 above."}],"42":[{"k":"p","t":"6-3. Test Mode"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Open the coin door and slide the test switch \u201cON\u201d. The Test Item and Test No. (number) are displayed on the Dot Matrix Display."},{"k":"li","t":"2. Press the Select switch to step to the next Item."},{"k":"li","t":"3. Press the Service switch to change the Test No. (number). Each time the service switch is pressed the Test No. (number) will change and the indicated test will begin."},{"k":"note","t":"Note: In the sound test, the number is changed by operating the trigger on the gun assembly."},{"k":"li","t":"4. Slide the Test switch OFF to return to normal game mode."},{"k":"note","t":"Note: Any credits established are lost each time the test switch is turned on or off."},{"k":"h","t":"Order Item Dot Matrix Display Description"},{"k":"tr","t":"1   Lamp test   LAMP TEST   Tests each of the lamps. One second after starting this"},{"k":"p","t":"(no value) test, the Dot Matrix lights completely and the lamp test starts. Test order"},{"k":"p","t":"The Dot Matrix Display lights completely Left Header lamp lights Right Header lamp lights SET] lamp lights START] lamp lights"},{"k":"p","t":"2 Operation test | MOTION TEST # | Tests the operation and sensor of each dirve unit. When the sensor for each operation is ON, all 5 digits of the 7 segment LED will display the number 8."},{"k":"p","t":"#= [1] Flat target (U) Assy movement test #= [2] Flat target (L) Assy movement test #= [3] Launcher Assy operation test #= [4] Flat target (U) Assy UP/DOWN operation 